---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
import { legacyPages } from '../lib/legacy-pages';
import { externalLinkAttributes } from '../lib/external-links';
---

<Layout
	title={legacyPages.about.title}
	description={legacyPages.about.description}
	canonicalPath={legacyPages.about.path}
>
	<div class="intro">
		<div>
			<p>
				Hi, I’m Pieter Nijs, a Belgian developer, trainer, speaker, and author. Most of my work is in
				the Microsoft ecosystem, especially .NET, C#, .NET MAUI, and Azure. Lately, I’ve also been
				exploring how AI can make everyday software more useful and reliable.
			</p>
			<p>
				I’ve worked on software for healthcare, telecom, media, and line-of-business applications.
				These days, I help design and integrate AI solutions, while continuing to build on the .NET
				tools I know best.
			</p>
		</div>
		<aside class="profile">
			<img
				class="portrait"
				src="/assets/pieter-nijs.jpg"
				alt="Pieter Nijs"
				width="512"
				height="512"
			/>
			<a
				class="mvp-link"
				href="https://mvp.microsoft.com/en-US/mvp/profile/afb27de4-e6d3-e711-80fd-3863bb2bca60"
				aria-label="Visit my Microsoft MVP profile"
				{...externalLinkAttributes}
			>
				<img
					class="mvp-badge"
					src="/assets/microsoft-mvp.png"
					alt="Microsoft Most Valuable Professional"
					width="125"
					height="197"
				/>
			</a>
		</aside>
	</div>

	<p>
		I teach .NET development at CVO Volt, where I create course materials and help students reach
		their learning goals. Outside the classroom, I write and speak about technology. I’m also a board
		member of <a href="https://www.visug.be/" {...externalLinkAttributes}>VISUG</a>, Belgium’s .NET user group, and part of the team
		behind <a href="https://techorama.be/" {...externalLinkAttributes}>Techorama</a>.
	</p>

	<p>
		When I’m not coding, tinkering, or breaking things to learn how they work, I’m usually sharing
		what I’ve learned with the developer community. I’ve been a Microsoft MVP since 2017.
	</p>

	<section class="book-feature" aria-label="My book">
		<p>
			I wrote <a href="https://www.amazon.com/MVVM-Pattern-NET-MAUI-cross-platform/dp/1805125001/" {...externalLinkAttributes}>
				<em>The MVVM Pattern in .NET MAUI</em>
			</a>, a practical guide to applying the MVVM pattern when building cross-platform apps with
			.NET MAUI.
		</p>
		<a
			class="book-cover"
			href="https://www.amazon.com/MVVM-Pattern-NET-MAUI-cross-platform/dp/1805125001/"
			aria-label="View The MVVM Pattern in .NET MAUI on Amazon"
			{...externalLinkAttributes}
		>
			<img
				src="/assets/mvvm-pattern-dotnet-maui.jpg"
				alt="Cover of The MVVM Pattern in .NET MAUI by Pieter Nijs"
				width="600"
				height="740"
				loading="lazy"
			/>
		</a>
	</section>

	<p>
		You can find me on <a href="https://bsky.app/profile/pieternijs.bsky.social" {...externalLinkAttributes}>Bluesky</a>,{' '}
		<a href="https://github.com/PieEatingNinjas" {...externalLinkAttributes}>GitHub</a>, and{' '}
		<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/pieter-nijs/" {...externalLinkAttributes}>LinkedIn</a>. I’m always happy to share ideas,
		learn something new, and meet people who are curious about what we can build with software and AI.
	</p>
</Layout>

<style>
	.intro {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 150px;
		gap: 1.5em;
		align-items: start;
	}

	.profile {
		grid-column: 2;
		grid-row: 1;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.75em;
	}

	.portrait {
		width: 100%;
		height: auto;
		aspect-ratio: 1;
		object-fit: cover;
		border-radius: 50%;
	}

	.mvp-link {
		display: block;
		line-height: 0;
	}

	.mvp-badge {
		width: 48px;
		height: auto;
	}

	.book-feature {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
		gap: 1.5em;
		align-items: center;
		margin: 2em 0;
	}

	.book-feature p {
		margin: 0;
	}

	.book-cover {
		display: block;
		line-height: 0;
	}

	.book-cover img {
		display: block;
		width: 120px;
		height: auto;
		border-radius: 3px;
		box-shadow: var(--box-shadow);
	}

	@media (max-width: 480px) {
		.intro {
			grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 110px;
			gap: 1em;
		}

		.book-feature {
			gap: 1em;
		}

		.book-cover img {
			width: 90px;
		}
	}
</style>
